                                "sense_id": "b53fd9b1-3a73-3208-b7b9-ddebe9206eda",
                                "text": "I stepped over to the corner and lifted the sheets of paper, and there she was, tinier than I had remembered, and no longer fierce or barksome, and no longer any super dog, capable of great and daring leaps of escape, but instead a quivering, terrified little pup."
