                                "sense_id": "b53fd9b1-3a73-3208-b7b9-ddebe9206eda",
                                "text": "Yet Hamlet thought he heard someone speaking, and not inside the stables, where grooms would be caring for the horses, and not in the kennels, either, where the barksome dogs were being fed and petted."
